[{ "action": "append", "id": "event-modals", "value" : "<div tabindex=\"-1\" id=\"modal-d733c9f3-43ed-4158-8bf7-8f2c5e249b18\" class=\"modal\"><div class=\"modal-dialog modal-lg\"><div class=\"modal-content\"><div class=\"modal-header\"><a data-dismiss=\"modal\" class=\"close\"><span class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-remove\"></span></a><p class=\"text-muted\"><span class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-road\"></span> Research Track</p><strong>Wed 30 Apr 2025 15:30 - 16:00 at <a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/room/icse-2025/icse-2025-venue-canada-hall-3-poster-area\" class=\"room-link navigate\">Canada Hall 3 Poster Area</a></strong> - <a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/track/icse-2025/icse-2025-posters#program\" class=\"navigate\">Wed Afternoon Break Posters 15:30-16:00</a><br/><strong>Thu 1 May 2025 13:30 - 14:00 at <a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/room/icse-2025/icse-2025-venue-canada-hall-3-poster-area\" class=\"room-link navigate\">Canada Hall 3 Poster Area</a></strong> - <a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/track/icse-2025/icse-2025-posters#program\" class=\"navigate\">Thu Lunch Posters 13:30-14:00</a></div><div class=\"modal-body\"><div class=\"bg-primary event-title\"><h4><span data-event-star=\"d733c9f3-43ed-4158-8bf7-8f2c5e249b18\" title=\"Add event to your program\"><span class=\"text-disabled glyphicon glyphicon-star-empty\"></span></span><strong>RustAssistant: Using LLMs to Fix Compilation Errors in Rust Code</strong></h4></div><div class=\"bg-info event-description\"><p>The Rust programming language, with its safety guarantees, has established itself as a viable choice for low-level systems programming language over the traditional, unsafe alternatives like C/C++. These guarantees come from a strong ownership-based type system, as well as primitive support for features like closures, pattern matching, etc., that make the code more concise and amenable to reasoning. These unique Rust features also pose a steep learning curve for programmers.</p>\n<p>This paper presents a tool called RustAssistant that leverages the emergent capabilities of Large Language Models (LLMs) to automatically suggest fixes for Rust compilation errors. RustAssistant uses a careful combination of prompting techniques as well as iteration between an LLM and the Rust compiler to deliver high accuracy of fixes. RustAssistant is able to achieve an impressive peak accuracy of roughly 74% on real-world compilation errors in popular open-source Rust repositories. We also contribute a dataset of Rust compilation errors to enable further research.</p>\n<p></p><p></p><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-sm-6\"><a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/profile/icse-2025/pantazisdeligiannis\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"navigate\"><div class=\"media\"><span class=\"pull-left\"><img alt=\"Pantazis Deligiannis\" src=\"https://conf.researchr.org/getProfileImage/pantazisdeligiannis/94e5ae43-3010-4be7-9784-85753acafd1f/micro-avatar?1783976657000\" class=\"outputimage media-object thumbnail no-bottom-margin\"/></span><div class=\"media-body\"><h5 class=\"media-heading\">Pantazis Deligiannis<span class=\"pull-right\"><small></small></span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><span class=\"text-black\">Microsoft Research</span></h5></div></div></a></div><div class=\"col-sm-6\"><a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/profile/icse-2025/akashlal\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"navigate\"><div class=\"media\"><span class=\"pull-left\"><img alt=\"Akash Lal\" src=\"https://conf.researchr.org/getProfileImage/akashlal/65982829-d01a-4dd8-ae71-40ce8e2d2ed7/micro-avatar?1783980322000\" class=\"outputimage media-object thumbnail no-bottom-margin\"/></span><div class=\"media-body\"><h5 class=\"media-heading\">Akash Lal<span class=\"pull-right\"><small></small></span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><span class=\"text-black\">Microsoft Research</span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><small>India</small></h5></div></div></a></div></div><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-sm-6\"><a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/profile/icse-2025/nikitamehrotra1\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"navigate\"><div class=\"media\"><span class=\"pull-left\"><img alt=\"Nikita Mehrotra\" src=\"https://conf.researchr.org/getProfileImage/nikitamehrotra1/33e0e740-13ae-4b35-a6db-20cf2179dbb4/micro-avatar?1783973339000\" class=\"outputimage media-object thumbnail no-bottom-margin\"/></span><div class=\"media-body\"><h5 class=\"media-heading\">Nikita Mehrotra<span class=\"pull-right\"><small></small></span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><span class=\"text-black\">Microsoft Research</span></h5></div></div></a></div><div class=\"col-sm-6\"><a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/profile/icse-2025/rishipoddar\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"navigate\"><div class=\"media\"><span class=\"pull-left\"><img alt=\"micro-avatar\" src=\"https://conf.researchr.org/getDefaultImage/micro-avatar?1783985080000\" class=\"outputimage media-object thumbnail no-bottom-margin\"/></span><div class=\"media-body\"><h5 class=\"media-heading\">Rishi Poddar<span class=\"pull-right\"><small></small></span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><span class=\"text-black\">Microsoft Research</span></h5></div></div></a></div></div><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-sm-6\"><a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/profile/icse-2025/aseemrastogi\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"navigate\"><div class=\"media\"><span class=\"pull-left\"><img alt=\"Aseem Rastogi\" src=\"https://conf.researchr.org/getProfileImage/aseemrastogi/f1c3aa1b-9f6d-4fdf-bc97-14432fae44fe/micro-avatar?1783971381000\" class=\"outputimage media-object thumbnail no-bottom-margin\"/></span><div class=\"media-body\"><h5 class=\"media-heading\">Aseem Rastogi<span class=\"pull-right\"><small></small></span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><span class=\"text-black\">Microsoft Research</span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><small>India</small></h5></div></div></a></div></div></div><br></div><div class=\"modal-footer\"><span class=\"pull-left\"><a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/detai